                                "sense_id": "24f7c629-2d6d-3043-9994-94fd871b4ac7",
                                "text": "Swing my ying-ying, tryna turn man history\nMasking my face, so I’m so mystery\n[…] Put rips in his teeth like fashion\nSwing my ying-yang\nTryna do him with a passion\n[…] I’m trying to inch up my ying"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "e62da12a-d115-4710-857d-01e207e286d3",
                                "sense_id": "24f7c629-2d6d-3043-9994-94fd871b4ac7",
                                "text": "The man just comin so fast\nThey all like some fucking athletes\nGot me screaming “where is your ying?”\nLike Imma tryna get you in the backstreets"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
